<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.913 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.913 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.913	 5.89-5.92   5.894 (Feb 26)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 25)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.943	 5.93-5.95   5.885 (Feb 19)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 66)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
